-- ============================================================================
-- Migration: Backfill mhr_records.specs from machine_library.json
-- Purpose: Populate real, sourced category-specific capability fields
--   (press force, roll diameter, bed dimensions, laser thickness tiers, etc.)
--   for the 281 USA machines seeded via build-mhr-import.mjs. That importer
--   deliberately left specs empty (economics-only seed); this migration is
--   the deferred capability-data half of that work, generated deterministically
--   from the same source file — never hand-typed, never fabricated.
-- Generated by: memory/sheetmetal/machine/build-mhr-specs-backfill.mjs
-- Regenerate with: node memory/sheetmetal/machine/build-mhr-specs-backfill.mjs
-- Source: memory/sheetmetal/machine/machine_library.json
-- Rows affected: 257 of 281 machines
--   (24 skipped as duplicate names — ambiguous match, not applied;
--    0 skipped — no category-specific fields beyond the
--    common economics/physical set already covered by dedicated mhr_records columns)
-- Idempotent: uses jsonb '||' merge, safe to re-run — re-running with the same
--   source file produces the same merged result every time.
-- ============================================================================

